                <div class="need-card-title label-small"><span data-i18n data-en="Application" data-et="Rakendus" data-ru="Приложение">Application</span><span class="tooltip-container"><i class="pi pi-info-circle info-icon"></i><span class="tooltip-text"><p data-i18n data-en="Request access to an application" data-et="Rakendusele ligipääsu taotlemine" data-ru="Запрос доступа к приложению">Request access to an application</p></span></span></div>
            </a>
            <a class="need-card" id="need-card-network-folder"
               href="$!{baseUrl}/plugins/servlet/supportal/access-or-permissions/network-folder">
